    "hero.role": "Professional in Conservation and Restoration of Cultural Heritage",
    "hero.thesis": "From a vision devoted to protecting our artistic and cultural heritage, this space exists to conserve, value and project cultural assets as living testimonies of identity, history and legacy — works that withstand the passing of time and keep dialoguing with the present and the future.",

    "perfil.lede": "01 — Profile",
    "perfil.h": "Professional in Conservation and Restoration of Cultural Heritage.",
    "perfil.p1": "Professional in the Conservation and Restoration of Cultural Heritage, trained at Universidad Externado de Colombia. I bring technical and analytical skills grounded in a deep understanding of the principles and criteria of the conservation and restoration of cultural property, as well as the research and analytical-evaluation methodologies that every treatment involves.",
    "perfil.p2": "My experience has been built through collaboration with cultural institutions and private collections in Colombia, taking part in treatments on a range of supports. I have experience in conservation and restoration treatments across typologies such as easel painting, polychrome sculpture and works on paper, applying rigorous, specialized processes of diagnosis, research and technical analysis according to the nature of each work.",
    "perfil.p3": "I also have experience in collection management and in implementing preventive-conservation strategies in museum institutions, art galleries, auction houses and private collections.",
    "perfil.t1n": "i — Principle",
    "perfil.t1t": "Minimal intervention",
    "perfil.t1d": "Limiting actions exclusively to those needed to ensure the stability and conservation of the work.",
    "perfil.t2n": "ii — Principle",
    "perfil.t2t": "Reversibility",
    "perfil.t2d": "The materials and procedures used can be removed or modified in the future without damaging the original components of the work.",
    "perfil.t3n": "iii — Principle",
    "perfil.t3t": "Material compatibility",
    "perfil.t3d": "Products and materials whose physical, chemical and mechanical properties are compatible with the work's constituent materials.",
    "perfil.t4n": "iv — Principle",
    "perfil.t4t": "Stability and durability of intervention materials",
    "perfil.t4d": "Long-term permanence and effectiveness of the treatments carried out.",
    "perfil.portraitAlt": "Stefania Díaz, conservator-restorer.",

    "exp.lede": "02 — Expertise",
    "exp.h": "Areas of work.",
    "exp.a1t": "Conservation and Restoration of Cultural Heritage",
    "exp.a1d": "Specialized interventions for the conservation and restoration of cultural property, carried out in accordance with the ethical, methodological and scientific criteria of the discipline.<br><br><span class=\"area__sub\">Areas of specialization:</span><ul class=\"area__list\"><li>Easel painting on canvas and panel support.</li><li>Polychrome sculpture.</li><li>Graphic works and documentary heritage.</li><li>Archaeological ceramics.</li></ul>",
    "exp.a2t": "Preliminary studies, condition and diagnosis <br class=\"area__brk\">for artworks and collections",
    "exp.a2d": "Comprehensive assessment of the condition of artworks and collections through specialized processes of examination, documentation, technical analysis and diagnosis. This service makes it possible to determine the material characteristics and manufacturing techniques of each cultural object, identify the agents and mechanisms of deterioration, evaluate its current condition, and establish the needs for conservation, restoration or the implementation of preventive-conservation measures.<br><br>Each study is carried out in accordance with the ethical and methodological principles of the conservation-restoration of cultural heritage, prioritizing rigorous technical documentation, well-founded critical analysis and responsible decision-making aimed at ensuring the conservation and material integrity of each work or collection.",
    "exp.a3t": "Preventive Conservation",
    "exp.a3d": "Analysis and assessment of environmental conditions for the proper protection of art collections and cultural property. Development and implementation of preventive-conservation strategies and plans for appropriate storage, handling, transport and display.",
    "exp.a4t": "Collection Management and Consultancy",
    "exp.a4d": "Coordination, organization and specialized stewardship of cultural property in public and private collections, integrating documentation, conservation, cataloguing and technical monitoring of the works. Professional support to collectors, galleries and auction houses in the responsible circulation of cultural property in the art market.",

    "foc.lede": "03 — Focus",
    "foc.statement": "Conservation and Restoration is only possible when understood as a collective endeavour that fosters critical reflection, dialogue and collaboration among all parties involved.",
    "foc.sub": "Bringing in qualified professionals adds value that professionalizes the market, positioning it as a tool in the service of Cultural Heritage.",
    "foc.imgAlt": "Stefania Díaz looking at a work in a museum gallery.",

